
<!-- SECTION 2: Get_BaseLine -->
<div class="section">
<h2><span class="num orange">2</span>Get_BaseLine() —— 底部扫线, 锚定起点</h2>
<div class="row-layout">
<div class="col">
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px">
<b>策略:</b> 抛弃图像最底部3行(行59~57), 从<b>行56</b>开始向上全列扫描5行(行56→52)。这5行作为后续向上追踪的<b>起始锚点</b>。
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px">
<b>为什么抛弃底部3行?</b> 行59~57太靠近车头, 可能拍到车身/底盘/阴影, 边界特征不可靠。跳过它们, 从行56开始更稳定。
</p>
<p style="font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:8px">
<b>为什么5行?</b> 单行可能有噪声, 取5行互相验证提高可靠性。
</p></div>
<div class="col">
<div class="code">
<span class="cmt">// Get_BaseLine() 核心逻辑</span>
<span class="kw">void</span> <span class="fn">Get_BaseLine</span>(<span class="kw">void</span>)
{
    <span class="kw">for</span> (Ysite = <span class="num">56</span>; Ysite &gt;= <span class="num">52</span>; Ysite--)
    {
        PicTemp = Pixle[Ysite];  <span class="cmt">// 第Ysite行</span>
        <span class="cmt">// 从中间(列39)往右扫右边界</span>
        <span class="kw">for</span> (i = <span class="num">39</span>; i &lt; <span class="num">79</span>; i++)
            <span class="kw">if</span> (PicTemp[i]==<span class="num">1</span> && PicTemp[i+<span class="num">1</span>]==<span class="num">0</span>)
                RightBorder = i;  <span class="cmt">// 白→黑跳变</span>
        <span class="cmt">// 从中间(列39)往左扫左边界</span>
        <span class="kw">for</span> (i = <span class="num">39</span>; i &gt; <span class="num">0</span>; i--)
            <span class="kw">if</span> (PicTemp[i]==<span class="num">1</span> && PicTemp[i-<span class="num">1</span>]==<span class="num">0</span>)
                LeftBorder = i;
        ImageDeal[Ysite].Center = (Left+Right)/<span class="num">2</span>;
    }
}
</div></div></div>

